o of them walk inside the  mysterious doorway together  as they do they both appear to vanish  into  thin air okay so i guess jericho isn't  the best babysitter but she's still  really hot okay  we then see bond rushing through the  forest in an attempt to find lancelot  but as we know it's too late by the time  bond arrives to the spot where the  doorway had been  lancelot and jericho are gone and so is  the rain  that means that the doorway itself is  gone and bond will not  be able to follow lancelot the text on  the final page  tells us that bonn and elaine searched  for lancelot and jericho for  years but their search didn't yield  any results finally several years later  prince lancelot returned as the prince  of the lake  but that is for another story the  sidebar of the page  also tells us to stay tuned because the  sequel manga  is being worked on as we speak this  is a pretty frustrating ending for all  of us who want more answers about what  just happened  but this side story definitely serves as  a great setup for the sequel  you better believe that i am now  extremely curious to find out what is  going to happen to lancelot and jericho  and what bond and elaine are going to do  now that their son is lost  at least for the time being thankfully  arthurian legend provides us with some  important  answers about what just happened to  lancelot  we all know that the 7 deadly sins  series is very heavily influenced by the  legend of king arthur  and the knights of the round table in  the past i made an entire video talking  about all the clues that arthurian  legend can provide us with for the  upcoming sequel  but this new side story gives us some  completely new  insight on the direction that the sequel  manga might take  in arthurian legend lancelot and tristan  are close friends  and they are among the strongest knights  of the round table  in the legend lancelot is the son of  king bon and queen elaine just like in  the seven deadly sins  but in arthurian lore king bond and  queen elaine are forced to flee their  kingdom by an  enemy king and they take the young  lancelot with them  as bond dies in elaine's arms  the young lancelot is taken by the lady  of the lake  and she then raises him inside her  magical realm  as a result of this unique upbringing  lancelot is sometimes called  lancelot duluck or lancelot  of the lake as we know the lady of the  lake has already been introduced  in the seven deadly sins story although  we know very little about her  we just know that she is a powerful  magical being created by chaos  and that she has access to secret  magical knowledge  clearly the seven deadly sins manga and  the sequel are not going to follow  arthurian legend exactly  ban and elaine were not forced to flee  by an enemy king and  bond did not die however it is clear  from this lancelot side story that  lancelot has just been taken  by the lady of the lake just like in the  original arthurian tale  why else would he eventually return as  the prince of the lake  which is very similar to the original  legend in which he returns as  lancelot of the lake continuing on with  lancelot in arthurian legend  we know that he is going to be knighted  and become one of the knights of the  round table  the lady of the lake will also give him  a powerful magical ring  that can break through any spell and i  expect that this ring might play an  important role  in the sequel beyond that we know that  lancelot is supposed to become involved  in a forbidden love affair  believe it or not lancelot has an affair  with queen guinevere  the wife of king arthur himself now  obviously we know that the seven deadly  sins take huge liberties with the  arthurian legend story  so i don't actually expect lancelot to  steal arthur's girl  although that would be a pretty crazy  twist but such raunchy romantic  intrigue just doesn't seem to fit into  the seven deadly sins world  at least that's my personal opinion i am  very curious to see why the lady of the  lake  in the world of the seven deadly sins  decided to take lancelot and raise him  inside her magical realm  in the original legend she raises  lancelot because his father king bond  dies but clearly that is not the case  here  also we know that in the world of the  summer deadly sins the lady of the lake  has a close connection to chaos power  and to excalibur so i wonder if chaos  power is going to play a role  in lancelot's upbringing slash training  at any rate  this entire side story was a very  interesting development  first we got to see how bond and elaine  are doing and we finally met  their son lancelot but then the side  story took a much darker turn  as bonn and elaine lost their son at  least for a number of years  and the culprit appears to be the lady  of the lake  we still don't know what exactly the  lady of the lake wants with lancelot  and i honestly can't wait to find out  more after this  massive cliffhanger i must say that i am  very excited for the sequel manga  but let me know what you guys think did  you enjoy this lancelot side story  and does it make you more excited for  the sequel  also do you like lancelot as a character  and why do you think that he was  seemingly abducted by the lady of the  lake  please share your thoughts down in the  comments below  and most importantly let me know if you  agree with me that jericho  is a top tier waifu even if she isn't  the greatest babysitter  if you enjoyed this video and you want  to see more seven deadly sins  and sequel content right here on the  channel please leave a like to let me  know  and if you happen to be new to anime  uproar or you just haven't subscribed  yet  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on  all notifications remember that you  really have to go through the trouble of  hitting that bell and selecting the  option that says  all that is the only way to make sure  that youtube will actually show you  our videos you can also follow me on  twitter and instagram  at anime uproar i want to give a big  thank you to all of our  anime emperor patrons who make videos  like this one possible  an extra special thank you to alpha a  disciple  of lord twego himself and i can't forget  are the one tier patrons the ones who  rise above  all other clans including ingrata  alolan adam the world steelers acquired  respect  pate heffer jonathan king brandon aviles  papa smurf emperor otaku thomas jones  and kin mano finally big thank you to  all of our pro hero tier  patrons including the one and only  gilgamesh nothing but a fan  jason wilson king zeldris anatoly  kazatsky angel cruz cricket xp  joe stanton very gucci alicia octor  jessica kayla  hinokami and water bonnie parks  wrathween de ora deadly saint and stern  hawkins  if you enjoy our videos and you feel  that they provide value to you consider  supporting us  on patreon even a single dollar will  give you access to our patreon exclusive  discord and your name will appear in our  videos  along with these amazing people as  always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya  space cowboys  [Music]  you


